<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1890] ignitevisorcmd: description for &quot;-dl&quot; key for &quot;log&quot; command should be updated</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1890</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
DESCRIPTION&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
Description for &quot;-dl&quot; key for &quot;log&quot; command is obsoleted&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
STEPS FOR REPRODUCE&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run ignitevisorcmd from IGNITE_HOME/bin&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Type &quot;help log&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
ACTUAL RESULT&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
The description of &quot;-dl&quot; is:
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&quot;-dl
        Disables collecting of job and task fail events, licence violation events, cache rebalance events from remote nodes.&quot;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
EXPECTED RESULT&lt;br/&gt;
---------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;
The description of &quot;-dl&quot; is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&quot;-dl
        Disables collecting of job and task fail events, cache rebalance events from remote nodes.&quot;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
